@startuml
title Laptop push (Stage 0)

actor Dev
participant "frontier plan" as Plan
participant "frontier apply" as Apply
participant Git
participant GitHub

Dev -> Plan : exam (OWASP, dirty tree)
Plan --> Dev : plan.passed or fail
Dev -> Apply : seal gate.passed
Apply --> Dev : ok
Dev -> Git : git push (feature branch)
Git -> Git : hook re-runs plan/apply
Git -> GitHub : refs/heads/feat/...
@enduml
